"content": "Identifies general information in short written or spoken conversations."}, {"type": "secondary_6", "content": "Gives appropriate directions to places taking into account the type of interlocutor."}, {"type": "secondary_7", "content": "Identifies general information in short written or spoken conversations."}, {"type": "secondary_8", "content": "Gives appropriate directions to places taking into account the type of interlocutor."}]}, {"type": "learning_points", "contents": [{"type": "heading", "content": "Requesting Information"}, {"type": "describer", "content": "When you need to ask a stranger for information, you use the<span class=\"strong\"> Simple Present Tense</span> and expressions like: <span class=\"italic\"> Excuse me \u2026 or Sorry \u2026 </span> to get their attention.<br><br>When you provide information to a stranger about your place of work, you can reply with an offer of help like <span class=\"italic\">How can I help you?</span>"}, {"type": "table", "content": "{\"rows\":2,\"columns\":2,\"cells\":[\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Requesting Information\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Providing information\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">Excuse me \u2026<br>Do you work here?<br>Where can I exchange some currency?<br>Could you tell me where \u2026 ?</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">Yes, how can I help you?<br><br>The exchange booth is here on your left.</span>\\\"}\"],\"styles\":\" intro_table_border instruction_table_background\"}"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "baggage claim area"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "the place in an airport where you collect your luggage"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: Please collect your suitcase at the baggage claim area."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn4le02ob01aud01"}]}, {"type": "target_word_describer", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": " These are words you use in a conversation at the airport."}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "oversized"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "an item that is too big"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(adjective)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: My suitcase is regular size, but my golf bag is oversized."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn4le02ob01aud02"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "booth"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "a counter where you can get information or other services"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: I need to get some US dollars at the currency exchange booth."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn4le02ob01aud03"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "surfboard"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "an item you use to ride over waves"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: My surfboard is not at the baggage claim area because it's oversized."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn4le02ob01aud04"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "to pick up "}, {"type": "definition", "content": "to get; to collect"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(verb)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: I need to pick up my suitcase."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn4le02ob01aud05"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "scuba diving"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "swimming underwater to explore marine life"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: I love scuba diving. There is so much to explore underwater!"}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn4le02ob01aud06"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "equipment"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "a set of items you use for an activity"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: You need a lot of equipment to go scuba diving."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn4le02ob01aud07"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "baggage carousel"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "the place in an airport where your luggage is delivered "}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: My suitcase is not on the baggage carousel!"}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn4le02ob01aud08"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "arrivals hall"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "the place in an airport where passengers arrive"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: The currency exchange booth is at the end of the arrivals hall."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn4le02ob01aud09"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "beachwear"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "items you wear on the beach"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: I can't find my suitcase! I have all my beachwear inside!"}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn4le02ob01aud10"}]}, {"type": "background_image", "content": "engenn4le02ob01re1img01.jpg"}, {"type": "takeaway_extension", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "Go online and look for 5 places that are in an airport."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Write a dialogue between you and the attendant. "}, {"type": "text", "content": "You ask for information about each of the places."}, {"type": "text", "content": "The attendant conveys information to you."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Practice your dialogue with a partner."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Switch roles."}]}, {"type": "takeaway_assessment", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "I use modals for requests."}, {"type": "text", "content": "I convey information to a stranger."}, {"type": "text", "content": "I use 5 target words."}]}], "type": "sena"}